  "explanation": "The question asks for the total population of Katwa. Two distinct referents emerge from the sources: (1) the town of Katwa and (2) the Katwa subdivision. D1S4 and D2S1 both cite the 2011 Census of India stating that the total population of the town of Katwa was 81,615. D5S1, D6S3, and D7S1 refer to the Katwa subdivision, noting its total population as 963,022 after the 2017 bifurcation of Bardhaman district. These are separate administrative units and thus represent distinct valid answers. The other candidates (12,345 and 50,000) either refer to incorrect geographic scopes or speculative projections and are not supported by clear, direct statements in the original sources."
